An opener at or past a description body's column closes its paragraph

```
:: term
:  definition
    [r]: /url
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>definition</dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
:: term
:  definition
   [r]: /url
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>definition</dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
:: term
:  definition
    # H
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>term</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>definition</p>
    <h1 id="H">H</h1>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

